    {
      "id": "Hbol",
      "code_hash": "152cde4dc271404e288c5258c9c18067",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"clinic-related-data-analysis\">Clinic Related Data Analysis</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Explore related healthcare clinic data interactively.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The data has three one-to-many relationships:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>clinic \u2192 patient \u2192 visit \u2192 lab result</strong></span>\n<h3 id=\"tables\">Tables</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Clinic</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>clinic_id</code></li>\n<li><code>clinic_name</code></li>\n<li><code>city</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Patient</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>patient_id</code></li>\n<li><code>clinic_id</code></li>\n<li><code>age</code></li>\n<li><code>age_group</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Visit</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>visit_id</code></li>\n<li><code>patient_id</code></li>\n<li><code>visit_type</code></li>\n<li><code>visit_minutes</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Lab Result</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lab_result_id</code></li>\n<li><code>visit_id</code></li>\n<li><code>test_name</code></li>\n<li><code>result_value</code></li>\n<li><code>unit</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sql-question\">SQL Question</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>How many visits does each clinic have,\nand what is the average visit length?</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">SQL joins the related clinic, patient, and visit\ntables and calculates the number of visits and\naverage visit length for each clinic.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The SQL query result is returned as a pandas\nDataFrame and visualized with Python.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
