    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "2fdfeab140ee290f438a432c1d3f878e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-text highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>## SQL Query\n\nThe following SQL joins the three related tables\nneeded to answer the question:\n\n```sql\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">SELECT\n    c.clinic_name,\n    c.city,\n    COUNT(v.visit_id) AS visit_count,\n    ROUND(AVG(v.visit_minutes), 1)\n        AS average_visit_minutes\nFROM clinic AS c\nJOIN patient AS p\n    ON c.clinic_id = p.clinic_id\nJOIN visit AS v\n    ON p.patient_id = v.patient_id\nGROUP BY\n    c.clinic_name,\n    c.city\nORDER BY\n    visit_count DESC;</span>\n<div class=\"language-teratermmacro highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>```\n\n<span class=\"nv\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">query</span>:\n\n<span class=\"mi\">1</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Joins</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">each</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">clinic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">its</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">patients</span>.\n\n<span class=\"mi\">2</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Joins</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">each</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">patient</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">their</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">visits</span>.\n\n<span class=\"mi\">3</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Counts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">visits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">each</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">clinic</span>.\n\n<span class=\"mi\">4</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Calculates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">average</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">visit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">length</span>.\n\n<span class=\"mi\">5</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Groups</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">results</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">clinic</span>.\n\n<span class=\"mi\">6</span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">Sorts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">clinics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">number</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">visits</span>.\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
